# Pine v6 engineering
- Target `//@version=6` unless compatibility is explicitly required.
- Separate inputs, derived series, signals, risk, orders, visuals, alerts, and diagnostics.
- Use descriptive names and typed variables where ambiguity exists.
- Keep entry and exit semantics explicit; document order timing and pyramiding.
- Minimize repeated calculations and `request.*()` calls.
- Preserve behavior during refactors; list intentional semantic changes.
- Never invent Pine functions or unsupported API behavior.
